  r0 --> r4: (H5-1.2) the desktop starts mid-pause: tracking starts, the folder appears, no park file
  r1 --> r2: paused, hand interaction on: kept (keep) and parked
  r1 --> r3: paused, hand interaction off: stop_units
  r1 --> r0: desktop down: handsmode down
  r2 --> r1: resume, or the dashboard opens (vrdash 1)
  r2 --> r4: (H5-2.1 H5-2.2) hand interaction off mid-pause: set_hands unparks, keep empties, nothing stops them
  r3 --> r1: resume starts the stopped list
  r4 --> r4: (H5-1.3) nothing runs update_park again until the dashboard or a resume
  r4 --> r1: resume
  r0 --> r5: ft-cutouts on
  r5 --> r4: (H5-3.1 H5-3.2) a pause, or on during one: not in UNITS, not parked without hand interaction
  r5 --> r1: desktop up: frametop-camd starts, Conflicts= stops the cutouts
  k0 --> k1: paused with hand interaction, the folder there
  k0 --> k2: (H5-1.1) paused before tracking ever ran: isdir fails, nothing written, parked True kept
  k1 --> k3: (H5-4.1) the dashboard opens: vrdash 1
  k3 --> k1: it closes: vrdash 0
  k3 --> k4: (H5-4.2 H5-4.3) the helper goes with it open, the new one starts with dashSent False and resends only in a game
  k1 --> k4: (H5-4.4) a new relay with the dashboard open thinks it closed, parks under it
  k4 --> k3: a game starts: vrdash every 5 s
  k1 --> k0: resume removes the file
  k2 --> k3: the dashboard opens and closes: written now
  h0 --> h1: ft-hands publishes again
  h1 --> h2: touch, a press, moving 0.15 m/s for 100 ms, or a hand moving with it 200 ms
  h2 --> h1: no touch 1.5 s, no press 3 s, still 3 s, no hand within 12 cm
  h2 --> h1: at once: no controller, charging, or lost 1 s with the hand 30 cm away
  h1 --> h0: nothing new from ft-hands for 1.5 s
  h1 --> o3: G3: the relay's ctl touch and press from vrserver's web socket
  n0 --> n1: allowed: the word says hand, worn, near input on
  n1 --> n2: poke, pinch the bar or a corner, a fist
  n2 --> n1: let go, a flick or a throw
  n2 --> n3: the word flickers off
  n3 --> n2: the word says hand again
  n3 --> n0: holdLostMs passes, or the hand is lost
  n2 --> n0: a controller or not allowed: EndPress, EndGrab
  n2 --> o2: G2: carries, stretches, throws and docks the panels drawn there
  y0 --> y1: a raised pointing hand, POINTER_HAND_RAY
  y1 --> y2: closing the fingers turns the hand, the ray drops
  y2 --> y1: it comes back, or a pinch brings it back
  y2 --> y0: the grace runs out with no other ray up
  y1 --> y1: the other hand pinches with its ray up: last used wins
  y1 --> y3: a ray pinch, after its claim lands (30 ms)
  y3 --> y1: the pinch ends: release
  y3 --> y4: lost, a grip, the ray off, or ft-hands quiet
  y4 --> y0: as lost, no click
  y1 --> y0: its side may not point: a controller, a game, the mouse, near a panel
  y3 --> o3: G3 K4 K5: the one trigger and leftHeld, shared with the mouse and a touch
  y1 --> o4: G4: an index pinch takes the calibration dot (CalPinch)
